epancy-index.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:24:31+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:19:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-interface/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-interface/", "title": "config interface \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "config interface \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 config interface \u306f\u7269\u7406\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\uff08PORT\uff09\u30fbPortChannel\u30fbSubInterface\u30fbLoopback \u306e state / \u901f\u5ea6 / FEC / link-training / autoneg / breakout / MTU / TPID\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-interface.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:23:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:44:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/sonic-cfggen/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/sonic-cfggen/", "title": "sonic-cfggen \u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "sonic-cfggen \u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 sonic-cfggen \u306f SONiC \u8a2d\u5b9a\u751f\u6210\u30a8\u30f3\u30b8\u30f3\u306e\u6c4e\u7528 CLI\u3002click \u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u306e config / show \u3068\u306f\u5225\u7cfb\u7d71\u3067\u3001argparse \u3067\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u5f15\u6570\u3092\u53d6\u308b Python \u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30c8\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/sonic-cfggen.png", "date_modified": "2026-05-26T14:23:04+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:04:07+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/", "title": "SONiC \u975e\u516c\u5f0f\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8", "content_html": "SONiC NOS (community